{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "5c4e004f16d735e97d75508fdf9febca8c50a7eea182d3421c08405adcd0380d", "ja": "みんな揃って生放送♪", "zh": "大家齐聚的生放送♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b611e1bdd2e7825f439e7ed3b92df06f7ab3c07cbb776377bcba05469c397d9f", "ja": "765プロのアイドル全員が出演する、大型\nバラエティ番組が始動。司会は瑞希、貴音、\n奈緒、可奈、ひなた。ファンに笑顔を届ける\nため、事務所一丸となって頑張ります。\n近日放送予定、お楽しみに！", "zh": "765艺能事务所全体偶像出演的大型\n综艺节目启动。主持人为瑞希、贵音、\n奈绪、可奈、日向。为了给粉丝们\n送去笑容，全事务所将齐心协力全力以赴。\n预定近日播出，敬请期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67de8ef8547d435300ba05fab3c83fa13349532b22a1ec468dfbcaee5a482eed", "ja": "（これから大型バラエティ番組の打ち合わせだ。\nもうみんな集まってるかな？）", "zh": "（接下来要开大型综艺节目的筹备会。大家已经到齐了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "dac8f7433c701af31d7ea50b8c06dc9cce80fc309ae3db95ddd80dde686958d0", "ja": "みなさん、『765 Theater Wave!』の\n企画書は読まれましたか？　……ワクワクだぞ。", "zh": "各位，《765 Theater Wave!》的\n企划书大家读过了吗？……让人好兴奋哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "d6c1adc4b01cb8e2a6cdfd0ad8e130ef58faba5cca3534c84c81e8e44c1ec346", "ja": "ええ。複数のユニットが、\n様々なこーなーをつないでいくばらえてぃ番組。", "zh": "嗯。由多个组合串联起各种环节的综艺节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "374354a08d9788606a539f73ef7e9b0858bfaa5563d18921addbd3fe2fe7eefe", "ja": "事務所の皆が出演できるとは。真、楽しみですね。\n中には少々変わった企画もありましたが……。", "zh": "没想到事务所的大家都能出演，实在令人期待呢。  \n其中也有一些稍显奇特的企划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "1bf1f2719a08560032039b7e8db70a7e44d6459eb05630205c736b46ec128550", "ja": "ああ、あったなぁ。\n私もちょいちょいツッコミ入れながら読んでたわ♪", "zh": "啊，确实有呢。\n我也是一边时不时吐槽，一边看完的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "e393d2b5d26d1cdd33a16125fa9a278b66c9f875ddafc813b95f18659e062d15", "ja": "しかも、全国放送なんだってねぇ？　北海道の\nばあちゃん達にも見てもらえそうで、うれしいべさ♪", "zh": "而且，听说还是全国播出呢？这样一来，北海道的奶奶们也能看到，真开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "ffedcdc63316a84b0d4b1d908f8c74489d1ab1ebad61bcd75c5b9d941d74052f", "ja": "あと配信もあったはずやから、\n全国やのうて、全世界の人が見るんとちゃうかな。", "zh": "而且应该还有网络直播，\n所以不只是全国，全世界的人都能看到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "3da9e36862495151665adf4411b4d65e860870d850e64e4919cbc8d547964a83", "ja": "ひゃ～。そんなにたくさんの人が見るのかい？\n……なんだか、恥ずかしくなってきたよぉ。", "zh": "呀～。会有那么多人看到吗？\n……感觉都有点不好意思了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "6d30cb44657e74cbecf9ca1f82ebd43afe64650a30fc7f9eac936a93d2b5aeb2", "ja": "でもでも、学校の文化祭みたいでワクワクします！\nみんなでお仕事～、どんなお仕事～♪", "zh": "可是可是，感觉就像学校的文化祭一样，让人好期待！\n大家一起工作～会是什么工作呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "7ef3d096a9c067f155dd00dc0005e7f19429d3382738d736d6f6add7f79bdbe6", "ja": "はれっ？　みんなでするお仕事なのに、\nどうして私たちが呼ばれたんだろう？", "zh": "咦？明明是大家一起做的工作，为什么会叫我们来呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1010_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4743f63739a5a29008d52d3963c86a111a3a82c719442f1c80fd36f5e9681835", "ja": "お疲れ様。全員きてるみたいだな。\nそれじゃ、打ち合わせをはじめようか。", "zh": "辛苦了。大家好像都到齐了。\n那么，我们开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c152b1a3531522d3f9b21a9a2624520edf31628bfd0235991b5b01e5d1f4f2bc", "ja": "簡単に説明すると、事務所のアイドル総出演の\nバラエティ番組を制作することになった。", "zh": "简单来说，就是要制作一档让事务所的偶像全员出演的综艺节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "30769092195ca35f40356a9d1aabda66957adfdbd19458eb144ec06e13ebbf11", "ja": "5人には、この番組の司会を任せたいと思ってる。", "zh": "我想把这个节目的主持工作交给你们5个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "82af103aaea46c2d25d1f474c02932425c2465f04f73ec30ffc64ce3db0628f6", "ja": "おお～。", "zh": "哦哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "82af103aaea46c2d25d1f474c02932425c2465f04f73ec30ffc64ce3db0628f6", "ja": "おお～。", "zh": "哦哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a2ceb3225eea937a3cca8a0dc40134762c6fe15062a8dc33de64e197bc42eb5", "ja": "えーっと……\n司会って、番組をまとめたりする役ですよね？", "zh": "那个……\n“主持人”就是负责统筹节目之类的人，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "88b7e0463c002f9a0603a490d8f900b04f091755887164331b0a79f327864bce", "ja": "そうです、矢吹さん。\n会を司る者……またの名を、マスターオブセレモニー。", "zh": "没错，矢吹小姐。\n司仪就是主持活动的人……也可以称作典礼主持人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "dd0772738111d489595e0fa049adbefa6afb4160d6d1a48e81b0ef710ebc4a22", "ja": "公演のMCとかじゃなくて、こんなにおっきな番組の\n司会だなんて……。あたしに務まるだろか……。", "zh": "不是演出的MC，而是这么大型节目的主持人……这种工作，我真的能胜任吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b8c309a377a074d40ffbad27956606d3a55a52ff0a6afcc9f16d58afbfd3f4b0", "ja": "まあ、公演のMCとは役割が違うけど、\nそう難しく考えなくても……。", "zh": "不过，虽然和公演的主持环节职责不同，也不用想得那么复杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "073dccca5772e7ffd9457357a6bf95d7bcef5953c615ae64e7651ec97af01779", "ja": "あーっ！！\n{$P$}さん、わかりました！", "zh": "啊——！！\n{$P$}先生，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "ef0d725ec3fa351346f04f488e3471cef002d6cd7f42f1e17e3c5516deeedce2", "ja": "なんで私らが司会に選ばれたか……\nそれは、『私らがバラエティやから』！　どうです？", "zh": "为什么我们会被选来当主持人……\n那是因为“我们就是综艺咖”！怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f5be3821f23f305a60872f50d55999bcadb3fd2005588ede43c9d54283fd2d3f", "ja": "ん？　どういう意味だ？", "zh": "嗯？是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "1d4d361f8140866ec804c27d684fe13efbf5820ba815a61ae2f0dd7be8ede577", "ja": "いや、だから！　ここにいる5人って、それぞれ\nバラエティに大事なもん、持ってると思うんです。", "zh": "哎呀，所以说啊！我觉得在场的这5个人，\n都各自具备着做综艺很重要的特质啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b9c68deae413ebb16d20b6a8f06012c99b1445f61566a49bbe637af6b4e0729", "ja": "可奈はとにかく元気で、ひなたは思いやりがあって。\n瑞希は、なんだかんだ熱いやないですか。", "zh": "可奈无论如何都很有活力，日向懂得体贴人。\n瑞希嘛，不管怎么说其实很热情对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "b26667e24554463bdf3856deadb1ec40904f52b36a12137e009abbca677278f2", "ja": "そして、ミステリアスな貴音！\nどれも笑いと結びついたら深みが出そうやなーって。", "zh": "还有神秘的贵音！\n我觉得，要是都和笑声联系起来，应该会更有深度吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "5db56317e292962aef65c3df7ac0b41f949127400235433894e09126efeb5938", "ja": "そこに笑いの真髄を知る奈緒が加わる、と。\nなるほど。こんせぷとにも相応しいかもしれませんね。", "zh": "这样一来，深谙笑之真谛的奈绪也加入进来了。原来如此，这或许也很符合主题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "b66a89c9ce0ea4d5c4b52642ac2b4e80ef8af4f7d1e2de1aeb3b9e5c960a697c", "ja": "そうなんだ。『みんなを元気に！笑顔をあなたに！』と\nいう番組のコンセプトに似合うメンバーで考えたんだ。", "zh": "原来如此。我选的成员都很适合“让大家打起精神！把笑容带给你！”这个节目的理念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c676d7503e0fcbda32b42602aaca3a7017427f812cf183e764f7c498252d5a8", "ja": "私たちって、バラエティだったんですね！\nあれ？　でもバラエティってどういう意味ですか？", "zh": "原来我们是综艺类型的呀！\n咦？不过综艺是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "03121c590f220e3ad722000d40bed2b01ed1347d209be8ac2acd6702669d55b9", "ja": "『変化がある』とか『多様性』という意味が近いかな。\n色々な企画があるから、バラエティ番組というんだ。", "zh": "大概接近“有变化”或者“多样性”的意思吧。\n因为有各种各样的企划，所以才叫综艺节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "5f7b0bc399a3ecc1d48484d5009e5b7a64ff502367f0dc55cbf323fc040ab9d7", "ja": "個性の違うアイドルがいるこの劇場もそうだな。\nだからこそ、みんなの個性や魅力がわかる番組なんだ。", "zh": "这个有着个性各异偶像的剧场也是如此。正因为这样，才会成为能让大家了解每个人个性与魅力的节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "9ea188c8064d5a3fe845ddaaadfd889b0f1ffe6aa2e39ba1e54e1d6e3cdae703", "ja": "そうですね。番組とは皆で作り上げていくもの。\n皆で力を合わせて、笑顔と元気を届けましょう。", "zh": "是啊。节目是大家共同打造的东西。让我们齐心协力，把笑容和活力传递给大家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_01_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "b9a0317cdef493e204f9b4c524f53d6431e473c7ba68d2146c3eae8033cec895", "ja": "うん！　みんなが一緒だって思ったら、\nあたしにもできそうな気がしてきたよぉ。", "zh": "嗯！一想到大家都在一起，我也觉得自己好像能做到了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
